  "title": "FLOWERS FOODS DECLARES QUARTERLY DIVIDEND",
  "summary": "THOMASVILLE, Ga., February 20, 2026 – Flowers Foods, Inc. (NYSE: FLO) today announced that its board of directors has declared a quarterly dividend of $0.2475 per share, an increase of 3.1% over the same quarter last year. This is the 94th consecutive quarterly dividend paid by the company and is payable on March 20, 2026,...",
